WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.650
The Maldives, 2025: 179 resorts, 973
guest houses and 168 safari vessels.

2
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.170
The World Bank calls tourism
the largest economic sector,

3
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.990
about 21 per cent of GDP.

4
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:23.010
Yet at the end of 2022, most of the people
working in its resorts were not Maldivian.

5
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:25.510
So where does a tourist's money go?

6
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:27.170
Only to foreign companies?

7
00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.950
Who really gains from a resort?

8
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.470
In this mission, you'll see
how transnational corporations,

9
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:38.390
from hotel chains to booking platforms,
connect remote places to the world.

10
00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.610
Then you'll follow the
money from one resort,

11
00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:44.250
and weigh the costs and
benefits for each stakeholder.

12
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.230
Your mission: find out who really
gains from a Maldives resort,

13
00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:49.710
and who gains most.
